    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/d84bcf4bf59d3822abafc4591e0af378.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice through your enemies. Parry, dash, and utilize colorful abilities to dispatch your foes. Dismember them into a cascade of colorful blood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/7f7692d81d4fafbba3d0f23737a72709.poster.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/7f7692d81d4fafbba3d0f23737a72709.webm?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/7f7692d81d4fafbba3d0f23737a72709.mp4?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/ec4cbac1020a95427ffd90af3c1ee534.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disembowel a gauntlet of bosses with unique move-sets, weapons, and abilities. Spears, guns, and chainsaws stand little chance against your trusty katana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/9acf53c8c5be3a430377e4bc8087c7dd.poster.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/9acf53c8c5be3a430377e4bc8087c7dd.webm?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/9acf53c8c5be3a430377e4bc8087c7dd.mp4?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/c3591ee70b559d9c88b4f4d433d3079f.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint a small open world with blood and graffiti. Vibe out to lo-fi samurai tunes. Together with your young companion, complete quests across multiple biomes. Journey through bustling towns, bamboo forests, crystal caves, rock and roll raves, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/afebe4ca63d7b3d00e5ece2d6c0d226b.poster.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/afebe4ca63d7b3d00e5ece2d6c0d226b.webm?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/afebe4ca63d7b3d00e5ece2d6c0d226b.mp4?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/f65ae9abeb0869ea040ecd962d2f90d3.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ren, in the face of an impossible order, cuts down his Shogun in cold blood. Alongside the baby he refused to kill, the duo makes their escape and settles into a normal life. As time passes, Ren waits anxiously for his past to catch up to him.     <br> <br>Years later, the Shogun's children seek revenge for the death of their father - not only on Ren, but on the young boy he cares for.  <br> <br>Hunt them down and slice their throats before they get the chance.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/d84bcf4bf59d3822abafc4591e0af378.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice through your enemies. Parry, dash, and utilize colorful abilities to dispatch your foes. Dismember them into a cascade of colorful blood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/7f7692d81d4fafbba3d0f23737a72709.poster.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/7f7692d81d4fafbba3d0f23737a72709.webm?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/7f7692d81d4fafbba3d0f23737a72709.mp4?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/ec4cbac1020a95427ffd90af3c1ee534.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disembowel a gauntlet of bosses with unique move-sets, weapons, and abilities. Spears, guns, and chainsaws stand little chance against your trusty katana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/9acf53c8c5be3a430377e4bc8087c7dd.poster.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/9acf53c8c5be3a430377e4bc8087c7dd.webm?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/9acf53c8c5be3a430377e4bc8087c7dd.mp4?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/c3591ee70b559d9c88b4f4d433d3079f.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint a small open world with blood and graffiti. Vibe out to lo-fi samurai tunes. Together with your young companion, complete quests across multiple biomes. Journey through bustling towns, bamboo forests, crystal caves, rock and roll raves, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/afebe4ca63d7b3d00e5ece2d6c0d226b.poster.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/afebe4ca63d7b3d00e5ece2d6c0d226b.webm?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/afebe4ca63d7b3d00e5ece2d6c0d226b.mp4?t=1728590462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684950/extras/f65ae9abeb0869ea040ecd962d2f90d3.avif?t=1728590462\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ren, in the face of an impossible order, cuts down his Shogun in cold blood. Alongside the baby he refused to kill, the duo makes their escape and settles into a normal life. As time passes, Ren waits anxiously for his past to catch up to him.     <br> <br>Years later, the Shogun's children seek revenge for the death of their father - not only on Ren, but on the young boy he cares for.  <br> <br>Hunt them down and slice their throats before they get the chance.</p>",
